{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 252, "line_no": 3, "text": "“水仲家”、“水稻民族”之称。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 330, "w": 515, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“水仲家”、“水稻民族”之称。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 330, "w": 515, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 252, "line_no": 4, "text": "在现代的农业生产中，布依族仍旧按照传统的岁时安排农事活动。布依族以气候的", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在现代的农业生产中，布依族仍旧按照传统的岁时安排农事活动。布依族以气候的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 252, "line_no": 5, "text": "含意来划分一年十二个月，分为“夜善换”、“细而换”、“若先换”", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 459, "w": 1118, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "含意来划分一年十二个月，分为“夜善换”、“细而换”、“若先换”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 459, "w": 1118, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
