{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 252, "line_no": 25, "text": "富、加工完善，最终形成了丰富多彩的布依族节日民俗事象。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1561, "w": 1053, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "富、加工完善，最终形成了丰富多彩的布依族节日民俗事象。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1561, "w": 1053, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
